  "item": {
    "entry": {
      "id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2",
      "headword": "关",
      "kind": "name",
      "reading": "Guān",
      "senses": [
        {
          "id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1",
          "definition": "the surname Guan"
        }
      ]
    },
    "examples": [
      {
        "sentence": "那人姓关，名羽，字寿长，后来改字云长，是河东解良人。",
        "gloss": "Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "关羽因杀了一个仗势欺人的人，逃走五六年。",
        "gloss": "Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "刘备告诉他自己的志向，关羽很高兴。",
        "gloss": "Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "刘备和关羽齐声答应。",
        "gloss": "Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "刘焉命邹靖带刘备、关羽、张飞三人，领五百士兵前去破敌。",
        "gloss": "Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "两军相对，刘备骑马在前，关羽在左，张飞在右。",
        "gloss": "Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "那人说：“我姓关，名羽，字寿长，后改字云长，是河东解良人。",
        "gloss": "Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "”刘备告知自己的志向，关羽大喜。",
        "gloss": "the surname Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "”刘备、关羽一齐答应。",
        "gloss": "the surname Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "两军相对，刘备骑马出阵，关羽在左，张飞在右。",
        "gloss": "surname Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "关羽骑马迎战，挥刀将程远志斩成两段。",
        "gloss": "surname Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "刘焉让邹靖带五千人，与刘备、关羽、张飞一同赶往青州。",
        "gloss": "Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      },
      {
        "sentence": "他对关羽、张飞说，敌众我寡，必须用伏兵应对。",
        "gloss": "Guan",
        "sense_id": "zh-5d0ae622f61f-2-s1"
      }
    ],
    "linked_components": []
  },
